// The meanings every generated language has a word for (V2.1 §10.1): Swadesh's core list of
// what every people talks of — people and kin, the body, the land and what lives on it, what one
// does and what things are like — with what the speech acts need (greetings, yes and no, thanks
// and sorry, go away). `name` is the gloss the player reads; `syllables` how long its word tends
// to be (the commonest meanings the shortest, Zipf's law of abbreviation).
